I'm going from the statnethack output at
http://alt.org/nethack/statnethack/statnethack.txt (though be aware
that the male column is missing a leading 1 for total games played).

Those numbers show that there are 7 classes easier to ascend than
valks, from easiest to hardest:

Caveman, knight, tourist, barbarian, healer, samurai, rogue, valkyrie,
ranger, archaeologist, priest, monk, wizard

But that's almost certainly selection bias: players who have never
ascended will play a lot of valks because they're rumored to be
easiest.  I can think of good reasons newbies like priests, monks, and
wizards too.



